      "explanation": "<p>Given that <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.566ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"21.008ex\" height=\"2.262ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -750 9285.7 1000\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D453\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D453\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(550,0)\"><use data-c=\"28\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-28\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(939,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D465\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D465\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1511,0)\"><use data-c=\"29\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-29\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2177.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(3233.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"5B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-5B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(3511.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D44E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D44E\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(4262.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(5263,0)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(6429.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"73\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-73\"></use><use data-c=\"69\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-69\" transform=\"translate(394,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"6E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6E\" transform=\"translate(672,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(7657.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"2061\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2061\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(7657.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"28\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-28\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(8046.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D465\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D465\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(8618.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"29\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-29\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(9007.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"5D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-5D\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>, where <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.566ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"2.075ex\" height=\"2.262ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -750 917 1000\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"5B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-5B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(278,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D461\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D461\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(639,0)\"><use data-c=\"5D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-5D\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> is the greatest integer function and <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.566ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"9.254ex\" height=\"2.262ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -750 4090.2 1000\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D465\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D465\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(849.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"2208\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2208\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1794.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"28\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-28\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(2183.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2683.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"2C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2C\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(3128.2,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D70B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D70B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(3701.2,0)\"><use data-c=\"29\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-29\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>.</p>\n<p>The function <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.566ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"2.075ex\" height=\"2.262ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -750 917 1000\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"5B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-5B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(278,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D461\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D461\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(639,0)\"><use data-c=\"5D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-5D\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> is not differentiable wherever <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.817ex\" height=\"1.441ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -626 361 637\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D461\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D461\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> is an integer because at these points, the function has a jump discontinuity.</p>\n<p>For <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.566ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"4.299ex\" height=\"2.262ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -750 1900 1000\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D453\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D453\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(550,0)\"><use data-c=\"28\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-28\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(939,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D465\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D465\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1511,0)\"><use data-c=\"29\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-29\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> to have a point of non-differentiability, the value inside the greatest integer function, i.e., <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.566ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"12.435ex\" height=\"2.262ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -750 5496.1 1000\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D44E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D44E\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(751.2,0)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1751.4,0)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(2918.1,0)\"><use data-c=\"73\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-73\"></use><use data-c=\"69\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-69\" transform=\"translate(394,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"6E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6E\" transform=\"translate(672,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(4146.1,0)\"><use data-c=\"2061\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2061\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(4146.1,0)\"><use data-c=\"28\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-28\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(4535.1,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D465\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D465\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(5107.1,0)\"><use data-c=\"29\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-29\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>, should be an integer. </p>\n<p>So, we need to find the values of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.294ex\" height=\"1.025ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -442 572 453\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D465\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D465\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> in the interval <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.566ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"5.194ex\" height=\"2.262ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -750 2295.7 1000\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"28\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-28\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(389,0)\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(889,0)\"><use data-c=\"2C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2C\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1333.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D70B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D70B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1906.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"29\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-29\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> for which <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.566ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"12.435ex\" height=\"2.262ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -750 5496.1 1000\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D44E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D44E\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(751.2,0)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1751.4,0)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(2918.1,0)\"><use data-c=\"73\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-73\"></use><use data-c=\"69\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-69\" transform=\"translate(394,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"6E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6E\" transform=\"translate(672,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(4146.1,0)\"><use data-c=\"2061\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2061\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(4146.1,0)\"><use data-c=\"28\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-28\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(4535.1,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D465\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D465\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(5107.1,0)\"><use data-c=\"29\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-29\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> is an integer.</p>\n<p>Now, <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.566ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"5.833ex\" height=\"2.262ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -750 2578 1000\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"73\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-73\"></use><use data-c=\"69\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-69\" transform=\"translate(394,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"6E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6E\" transform=\"translate(672,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1228,0)\"><use data-c=\"2061\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2061\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1228,0)\"><use data-c=\"28\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-28\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1617,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D465\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D465\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2189,0)\"><use data-c=\"29\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-29\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> varies from 0 to 1 in the interval <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.566ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"5.194ex\" height=\"2.262ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -750 2295.7 1000\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"28\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-28\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(389,0)\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(889,0)\"><use data-c=\"2C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2C\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1333.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D70B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D70B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1906.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"29\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-29\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>, so the maximum value of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.566ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"8.472ex\" height=\"2.262ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -750 3744.7 1000\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1166.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"73\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-73\"></use><use data-c=\"69\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-69\" transform=\"translate(394,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"6E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6E\" transform=\"translate(672,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2394.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"2061\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2061\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2394.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"28\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-28\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(2783.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D465\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D465\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(3355.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"29\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-29\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> in this interval is 13.</p>\n<p>For each integer value of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.566ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"8.472ex\" height=\"2.262ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -750 3744.7 1000\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1166.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"73\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-73\"></use><use data-c=\"69\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-69\" transform=\"translate(394,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"6E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6E\" transform=\"translate(672,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2394.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"2061\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2061\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2394.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"28\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-28\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(2783.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D465\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D465\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(3355.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"29\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-29\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> between 0 and 13, we'll have a corresponding value of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.294ex\" height=\"1.025ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -442 572 453\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D465\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D465\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>. There will be two such values of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.294ex\" height=\"1.025ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -442 572 453\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D465\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D465\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> for each value of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.566ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"8.472ex\" height=\"2.262ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -750 3744.7 1000\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1166.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"73\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-73\"></use><use data-c=\"69\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-69\" transform=\"translate(394,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"6E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6E\" transform=\"translate(672,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2394.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"2061\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2061\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2394.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"28\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-28\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(2783.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D465\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D465\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(3355.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"29\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-29\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> (because of the periodic and symmetric nature of sine function over the interval <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.566ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"5.194ex\" height=\"2.262ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -750 2295.7 1000\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"28\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-28\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(389,0)\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(889,0)\"><use data-c=\"2C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2C\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1333.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D70B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D70B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1906.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"29\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-29\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>), except for the maximum value, 13, which will have only one corresponding value of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.294ex\" height=\"1.025ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -442 572 453\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D465\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D465\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> (namely <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.781ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"6.223ex\" height=\"2.361ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -698.8 2750.7 1043.8\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D465\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D465\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(849.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(1905.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(220,394) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D70B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D70B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(245.8,-345) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><rect width=\"605.2\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>).</p>\n<p>Thus, the total number of integer values of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.566ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"8.472ex\" height=\"2.262ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -750 3744.7 1000\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1166.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"73\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-73\"></use><use data-c=\"69\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-69\" transform=\"translate(394,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"6E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6E\" transform=\"translate(672,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2394.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"2061\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2061\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2394.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"28\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-28\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(2783.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D465\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D465\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(3355.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"29\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-29\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> between 0 and 13 is 13. Excluding the maximum value, we have 12 integer values, each giving rise to two values of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.294ex\" height=\"1.025ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -442 572 453\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D465\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D465\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>. Including the maximum value, which gives one value of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.294ex\" height=\"1.025ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -442 572 453\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D465\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D465\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>, we have :</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.186ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15.336ex\" height=\"1.692ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -666 6778.4 748\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1222.2,0)\"><use data-c=\"D7\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-D7\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(2222.4,0)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2944.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(3944.9,0)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(4722.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(5778.4,0)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use><use data-c=\"35\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-35\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Thus, <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.566ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"4.299ex\" height=\"2.262ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -750 1900 1000\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D453\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D453\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(550,0)\"><use data-c=\"28\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-28\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(939,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D465\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D465\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1511,0)\"><use data-c=\"29\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-29\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> is not differentiable at 25 points in the interval <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.566ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"5.194ex\" height=\"2.262ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -750 2295.7 1000\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"28\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-28\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(389,0)\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(889,0)\"><use data-c=\"2C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2C\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1333.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D70B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D70B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1906.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"29\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-29\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>.</p>"
